    "detailed_description": "This game is a chapter based indie horror game, where you try to find your Missing friend! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game you play as the protagonist John who has to find your missing friend, Billy. Billy worked at a lab and you heard that the lab recently was shut down for an unknown reason, so you suspect that they are connected in some form. You get a call from Billy, saying he needs your help with something at his hut, you drive to the hut expecting Billy there, but you find something else...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game will have Some patches and updates with new chapters. Maybe some Dlc's. If you buy this early, your in for a treat, as I said its gonna get updated. With every update comes a new chapter, so be ready. One day you might just find your friend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI'm gonna stop spoiling the entire game and let you enjoy it for yourself!",
